From 2c5470c41883896362ebce8589b40cd6bf6468cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vamsi Tulugu <vamsi@example.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 08:36:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Dashboard: events row, per-person mood graph/calendar, card
 photo editor, quick pages; Girl/Boy signup + Period page access

- Dashboard: shortcuts now Memories/Calendar/Music/Movie/Meet Planner/Bucket List/Daily Routine
- Dashboard: 'Coming up' row (birthdays, anniversary, monthly + day milestones, calendar events)
- Dashboard: mood card with both partners' 7-day graph + full-screen mood calendar (You / Partner)
- Dashboard: 16:9 crop photo editor for the Hug/Touch/Miss card (saved as links, synced)
- Dashboard: all-pages quick grid and closing quote
- Signup: Girl/Boy option; stored in shared profile; changeable in Settings
- Period page: girl edits, boy sees everything read-only (client + server guard)
- Server: only the sender can change their own profile entry (stops stale overwrites)
